From: koya <235002527+matsuo-koya@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 10:31:46 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] filin: advertise _airdrop._tcp in MIF Service Response
 TLVs + service bloom

iOS 27 senders browse AirDrop receivers from AWDL Service Response TLVs and
send no mDNS on awdl0. Parse luftlift's own mDNS announce from the TAP and
re-emit PTR/SRV/TXT as type-2 TLVs (byte-identical layout to macOS receivers)
with bloom bits 158/183 in the Service Parameters TLV.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
